                                        "entry_id": "b8fcc97e-8c16-3071-b1e7-ff5e0ef51e9f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The killing or punishment of every tenth person, usually by lot."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ancient-Rome",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d213451-f19e-4542-9217-b0dbabd666bb",
                                                "sense_id": "fb8591d2-4572-397c-9000-b04a6a12e593",
                                                "text": "By decimation and a tythed death; / If thy Reuenges hunger for that Food, / Which Nature loathes, take thou the deſtin'd tenth, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "205f80df-2a4a-3d83-ac7f-15b278dfa8bb",
                                        "entry_id": "b8fcc97e-8c16-3071-b1e7-ff5e0ef51e9f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The killing or destruction of any large portion of a population."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd8770fc-1b0d-4857-991a-09c1a60f4a43",
                                                "sense_id": "205f80df-2a4a-3d83-ac7f-15b278dfa8bb",
                                                "text": "And the vvhole Army had cauſe to enquire into their own Rebellions, vvhen they ſavv the Lord of Hoſts, vvith a dreadful Decimation, taking off ſo many of our Brethren by the vvorſt of Executioners."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfbe3c27-6cb7-4e3c-878b-856497c0fc7c",
                                                "sense_id": "205f80df-2a4a-3d83-ac7f-15b278dfa8bb",
                                                "text": "General Secretary Mick Lynch said: \"It is crystal clear that the planned cutbacks on ScotRail and SWR are just the tip of the iceberg, as cynical employers use the cloak of COVID-19 to smuggle through the decimation of jobs and services on Britain's railways."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
